# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# CoreForm — only the live website goes to GitHub.
#
# Everything in this repo is uploaded to cyberfolks by the GitHub Action
# (.github/workflows/deploy.yml). So this file is a WHITELIST: the top
# level is ignored by default and only the website is let back in. A new
# file or folder at the root stays local until it is added below.
#
# Local only (kept on this PC, never pushed): _local/ (originals, notes,
# archive, Netopia docs), supabase/ (migrations + edge functions), tools/,
# serve.mjs, screenshot.mjs, package*.json, node_modules/, CLAUDE.md,
# config.example.js, temporary screenshots/, .vscode/.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Ignore everything at the top level…
/*

# …except the website and the files git/GitHub need
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/.github/
!/.htaccess
!/*.html
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/manifest.json
!/sw.js
!/css/
!/js/
!/img/
!/pdfs/

# Supabase credentials: generated by the deploy Action from GitHub Secrets.
# Locally, copy config.example.js to js/config.js.
/js/config.js

# OS / editor noise anywhere
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.log
